    "question": "<style> img, svg {vertical-align: middle; max-width:100%; } *{overflow-wrap: break-word;}  </style> <p><span style=\"font-family:'Arial Unicode MS'\"> 1 कूलॉम/1s = ...........</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Arial Unicode MS'\">1 Coulomb/1s = ...........</span></p>",
